# The shape the book binary uses when no --taper is given, written out so it
# can be edited rather than recompiled.
#
# Effort belongs where it changes a decision. A first move is worth minutes
# because every line hangs off it; a position forty plies into a sideline is
# worth a second, because by then the question is whether the line survives at
# all rather than exactly how well it stands.
#
# Margins narrow with depth for the same reason. Near the start, a move 60
# behind best is a real alternative worth having an answer to. Forty plies in,
# a line that far behind is not going to be played.
#
# ply  nodes        multipv  margin
0      300000000    8        60
7      60000000     6        45
15     20000000     4        30
25     6000000      3        20
37     2000000      2        12
